{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2062, twenty years after a treaty legalized human cloning for organ harvesting, an incubator malfunctions\u00a0in Vitacorp\u2019s mega factory and a boy pops out. Opening his eyes for the first time he is Overwhelmed by the sight and pure size of the mega factory. The boy succumbs to his instincts: ESCAPE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 1 hour indie experience, Stealth and puzzle solving are the key to your escape. While hacking terminals and distracting Robots and drones you will Traverse the dark ambient areas the game has to offer and uncover the secrets of Vitacorp\u2019s factories.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119070?t=1763733699","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119070?t=1763733699","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119070/2150e648a5b3d6e09eaeb57b6351215bb41349b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763733699","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119070/2150e648a5b3d6e09eaeb57b6351215bb41349b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763733699","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2062, twenty years after a treaty legalized human cloning for organ harvesting, an incubator malfunctions\u00a0in Vitacorp\u2019s mega factory and a boy pops out. Opening his eyes for the first time he is Overwhelmed by the sight and pure size of the mega factory. The boy succumbs to his instincts: ESCAPE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 1 hour indie experience, Stealth and puzzle